text:
zoe: Running the onboarding sampleapp with client-side prefetch + pagination. Hit soft 429s when token rotates mid-prefetch. Seems like prefetch workers are stealing permits during auth-retry. Reproable locally.

mike: Can you paste a log extract?

zoe: short log:
```
INFO prefetch id=pref-12 inflight=4 action=fetch status=401
INFO auth refresh start tok=tmp-7
INFO auth refresh done tok=tmp-8
INFO retry prefetch id=pref-12 inflight=5 duplicate send
WARN upstream 429 backlog=66
```
The prefetch path does an internal retry but doesn't release the window slot on the error path, so inflight climbs above windowSize.

liyah: Sounds similar to previous token-retry leaks but this is trickier because prefetch spawns background pagination that doesn't surface errors to the caller.

kevin: Two short options: 1) Make auth wrapper release-before-refresh and reacquire after (racy, but quick), or 2) implement lease-based acquires so retries reuse the same opaque lease id and background tasks don't double-acquire. Lease is cleaner.

mike: Lease sketch:
```js
// acquire returns an opaque lease token
const lease = await window.acquireLease();
try {
  await prefetchPage({leaseId: lease.id, page});
} finally {
  window.releaseLease(lease.id);
}
// prefetchPage must reuse leaseId on retry instead of acquiring again
```
This way background retries keep accounting 1:1.

zoe: Repro steps I'm using: set client.windowSize=4, enable prefetch(2) so each request prefetches next page, start 120-page-scanner job, then flip auth server to 401 for a short window. You'll see inflight climb to 6-8 and duplicate page hits.

liyah: I'll add a small flaky integration test in sampleapp that toggles auth responses to force the path and asserts inflight <= windowSize. That should reproduce deterministically in CI with a timing stub.

kevin: If you add the test I can implement the lease support in the JS SDK and add a parity note for other SDKs. Also update the quickstart docs with a short section: "Why leases prevent double-acquire during auth retries and background prefetching."

ci-bot: Created ephemeral job sampleapp-flaky-auth-1765432120 and attached logs.

devex-bot: Created ticket RDW-4001: "sampleapp: prefetch inflight overshoot during token-rotation; implement lease-based windowing" and linked branch r/patch/prefetch-window-lease. Assigning kevin for SDK change and liyah for the test. :thumbsup:
